  "body": "## What happens\n\nOn main, two `#[ignore]`d heavy tests in `crates/app/tests/operations.rs` fail in the release lane (`app heavy: operations`):\n\n- `swarf_generates_blade_lying_axes_and_verifies_clean_full_band`\n- `advanced_swarf_adds_the_coarse_rungs_full_band`\n\nBoth stop at `verifies_clean` (`crates/app/tests/operations.rs:4984`):\n\n```\nSWA must verify with zero blocking warnings: [RapidInPart { at: 2141 }, RapidInPart { at: 2265 }, RapidInPart { at: 2391 }, RapidInPart { at: 2517 }, RapidInPart { at: 2643 }, RapidInPart { at: 2743 }, RapidInPart { at: 2868 }, RapidInPart { at: 2989 }, RapidInPart { at: 3110 }]\nSW1 must verify with zero blocking warnings: (the same nine warnings)\n```\n\nThe verifier blocks the post, so no wrong program goes out. But the release gate of the next cut is red on this step.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nOn a branch that is upstream/main `583d05fda` plus one machine file (no code change):\n\n```\ncargo test -p camcraft-app --release --test operations -- --ignored --exact \\\n  swarf_generates_blade_lying_axes_and_verifies_clean_full_band \\\n  advanced_swarf_adds_the_coarse_rungs_full_band\n```\n\nResult: `0 passed; 2 failed`. The same two tests failed with the same nine move indices in `cargo xtask gate heavy` on PR #4288. That PR does not touch the swarf code.\n\n## Facts that can help\n\n- The warnings are rapids that the verifier finds inside the part, about every 125 moves. That looks like one rapid link for each raster or band.\n- A recent change to the swarf approach is `09d515d7e` (\"fix(multiaxis): swing the rotaries before the approach descent\", 2026-11-22). I did not prove that it is the cause.\n- #1404 was an earlier red state of the same two tests (`SweepHit`).\n\n## Done means\n\nThe two tests pass in the release lane on main, or each test has the known-fail marker with this issue number (AGENTS.md, \"Tests that start red use the known-fail marker\").\n\nI cannot set labels as a contributor. My recommendation is `P2` (a gate on main is red), `area:multiaxis`, `effort:high` (safety floor: a collision check), `source:agent`.\n",
